[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 24000.15, "timestamp": "06:40:00", "text": "四，放四。这就是最初的想法。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24001.02, "timestamp": "06:40:01", "text": "诚实"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24002.99, "timestamp": "06:40:02", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24006.708, "timestamp": "06:40:06", "text": "你。但我本来很容易就能做到这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24009.03, "timestamp": "06:40:09", "text": "这个想法用案例语句会更好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24013.19, "timestamp": "06:40:13", "text": "就像在这里放一个，然后就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24016.39, "timestamp": "06:40:16", "text": "呃，很多事。但问题在于"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24020.19, "timestamp": "06:40:20", "text": "这就是我无法将两个放在一起的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24023.11, "timestamp": "06:40:23", "text": "这里。我不能把那一个放进去。哦，等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24025.948, "timestamp": "06:40:25", "text": "我不能放那个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24028.39, "timestamp": "06:40:28", "text": "嗯？等一下。等等，等等，等等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24030.31, "timestamp": "06:40:30", "text": "等等，等等，等等，等等，等等。他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24044.708, "timestamp": "06:40:44", "text": "三。哦，这个人。哦，你吓死我了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24046.708, "timestamp": "06:40:46", "text": "等等，他们得到了支持。等等，什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24048.788, "timestamp": "06:40:48", "text": "好的，等等。好的，我们就用这种方法。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24050.99, "timestamp": "06:40:50", "text": "是的，我们正在采用这种方法。我们开始吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24053.67, "timestamp": "06:40:53", "text": "去。所以，我们的想法是这样的："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24059.99, "timestamp": "06:40:59", "text": "使困惑。再说一遍，这更像是一种"}]